# Architecture Boundaries

- Follow existing structure only; common folders include `src/app`, `src/components`, `src/features`, `src/hooks`, `src/lib`, `src/styles`, `src/utils`
- Keep dependency direction: `app` -> `features` -> `components` + `lib`
- `features` may use `lib`, but `lib` must never import from `features`
- Routes only under `src/app`; no route logic elsewhere
- Follow App Router conventions
- Feature orchestration stays in `src/features`, not components
- Reusable UI belongs in `src/components` at the correct level
- Normalize API payloads in `src/lib/adapter`, not in UI
- AI/LLM integrations stay server-side under `src/app/api`

## Placement Shortcuts
- API calls: `src/lib/services/**`
- Query hooks: `src/lib/query/**`
- Client state (Zustand): `src/lib/store/**`
- Shared types: `src/lib/types/**`
- AI route handlers: `src/app/api/**`
